#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This collection of Qiskit in-classroom modules is designed for an "
"undergraduate-level course in computer science, quantum computing, or "
"introductory quantum mechanics. The goal is to help educators and students "
"leverage quantum computers to experimentally explore foundational quantum "
"protocols and algorithms, such as quantum teleportation, quantum key "
"distribution (QKD), and the Deutsch-Jozsa and Bernstein-Vazirani "
"algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kumpulan modul dalam kelas Qiskit ini dirancang untuk kursus tingkat sarjana"
" dalam ilmu komputer, komputasi kuantum, atau mekanika kuantum pengantar. "
"Tujuannya adalah membantu para pengajar dan mahasiswa memanfaatkan komputer "
"kuantum untuk mengeksplorasi secara eksperimental protokol dan algoritma "
"kuantum dasar, seperti teleportasi kuantum, distribusi kunci kuantum (QKD), "
"serta algoritma Deutsch-Jozsa dan Bernstein-Vazirani.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each module should be started in class with group and instructor support, "
"but can be completed independently or in small groups. All activities can be"
" completed in much less time than the free time allotted as part of the Open"
" Plan available to all users. Simulator options are also built-in in case "
"students accidentally exhaust their free quantum computing time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap modul sebaiknya dimulai di kelas dengan dukungan kelompok dan "
"instruktur, tapi bisa diselesaikan secara mandiri atau dalam kelompok kecil."
" Semua aktivitas bisa diselesaikan jauh lebih cepat dari waktu gratis yang "
"tersedia sebagai bagian dari Open Plan untuk semua pengguna. Opsi simulator "
"juga sudah tersedia kalau-kalau mahasiswa tidak sengaja menghabiskan waktu "
"komputasi kuantum gratis mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instructors can request versions of these notebooks with answer keys and "
"guidance on placement in common curricula by filling out this [quick "
"survey](https://ibm.biz/classrooms_instructor_key_request) on how the "
"notebooks are being used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para instruktur bisa meminta versi notebook dengan kunci jawaban dan panduan"
" penempatan dalam kurikulum umum dengan mengisi [survei "
"singkat](https://ibm.biz/classrooms_instructor_key_request) tentang cara "
"notebook digunakan ini.\n"

